    aidgo:alignmentBasis aidgo:FunctionalEquivalence ;
    aidgo:alignmentGap "ISO 5259-3 does not reference the high-risk AI regulatory classification or the specific quality criteria in Art 10(2)-(5)."@en ;
    aidgo:alignmentJustification "ISO 5259-3 §7.3.2.1 requires a data specification validated as consistent and complete for intended use, functionally aligning with Art 10(1). Gap: ISO 5259 is sector-neutral and does not specifically address high-risk AI systems under regulatory oversight."@en ;
    aidgo:alignmentType aidgo:PartiallySatisfies ;
    aidgo:coveredCQs "CQ-M2, CQ-M5, CQ-M7" ;
    aidgo:legalRequirement aiapr:AiaPrReq_10.1 ;
    aidgo:technicalRequirement iso5259:AidgoReq_7_3_2_1 ;
    aidgo:validationStatus aidgo:ExpertValidated .

